"""Offline W62 Outlaw socket proof and +70-stat/0.9-duration reload extraction.

--verify is strictly read-only and checks every input SHA and generated byte.
--output-root supports disjoint reproduction without touching the source checkout.
Full articles/search captures stay private under /tmp/destiny-weapons-w62.
"""
